OL,3,GNEWSA'Our son's law will save
OL,4,Agenerations of children'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a boy whose death after
OL,7,Fan allergic reaction prompted a change
OL,8,Fin the law have said it will "protect
OL,9,Fgenerations of children".
OL,11,FBenedict Blythe, five, died after
OL,12,Faccidental exposure to cow's milk
OL,13,Fprotein while at Barnack Primary
OL,14,FSchool, near Peterborough, in December
OL,15,F2021.
OL,17,FThe first phase of Benedict's Law came
OL,18,Finto effect this week, requiring
OL,19,Fschools in England to follow
OL,20,Fstrengthened allergy guidelines.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
